{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod Shooter: the fast-paced arena FPS where the rules change every game! Mod Shooter is a chaotic arena FPS with <strong>modifiers</strong>, <strong>pickups</strong>, <strong>dynamic maps</strong>, <strong>various</strong> <strong>guns</strong>, and <strong>multiple</strong>\u00a0<strong>game modes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod Shooter is designed to be played with friends - inspired by LAN parties with custom lobbies, Mod Shooter changes the rules of the game every round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bringing The Arena Shooter Back To Its Roots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across multiple dynamic maps and game modes, modifiers will fundamentally shape how you play each game of Mod Shooter. No two games will ever be the same. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more control? The host can also manually modify the game settings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835300/extras/b64a433d63af5431959d0c520b6ec3c7.avif?t=1757468922\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Unlockable Characters -- <i>no microtransactions!</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Game Modes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Pickups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Guns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Thousands </strong></i><strong>of Unique Game Combinations!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835300/extras/394fabce60a0c9f2318bda4294de8bfe.poster.avif?t=1757468922\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835300/extras/394fabce60a0c9f2318bda4294de8bfe.webm?t=1757468922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835300/extras/394fabce60a0c9f2318bda4294de8bfe.mp4?t=1757468922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that there is currently no public matchmaking, and only private invite-only lobbies are supported. Bots can be toggled at any time in coop game modes or to fill out the lobbies up to the recommended number of players for each map. Public lobbies and matchmaking may possibly be added in a future update.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2835300?t=1757468922","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2835300?t=1757468922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835300/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757468922","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835300/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757468922","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod Shooter: the fast-paced arena FPS where the rules change every game! Mod Shooter is a chaotic arena FPS with <strong>modifiers</strong>, <strong>pickups</strong>, <strong>dynamic maps</strong>, <strong>various</strong> <strong>guns</strong>, and <strong>multiple</strong>\u00a0<strong>game modes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod Shooter is designed to be played with friends - inspired by LAN parties with custom lobbies, Mod Shooter changes the rules of the game every round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bringing The Arena Shooter Back To Its Roots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across multiple dynamic maps and game modes, modifiers will fundamentally shape how you play each game of Mod Shooter. No two games will ever be the same. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more control? The host can also manually modify the game settings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835300/extras/b64a433d63af5431959d0c520b6ec3c7.avif?t=1757468922\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Unlockable Characters -- <i>no microtransactions!</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Game Modes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Pickups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Guns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Thousands </strong></i><strong>of Unique Game Combinations!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835300/extras/394fabce60a0c9f2318bda4294de8bfe.poster.avif?t=1757468922\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app